                                "sense_id": "9e5a89cd-3fa7-3b25-9717-fac521e55c55",
                                "text": "Gareth Bale gave his side hope with a goal shortly afterwards but the real damage was done and Chelsea reasserted their authority to finish easy winners with further goals from Ramires, Frank Lampard and Florent Malouda."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cd9be8c-5dea-4a18-a443-7059535d5cf1",
                                "sense_id": "9e5a89cd-3fa7-3b25-9717-fac521e55c55",
                                "text": "They were tied to a revived religious class that took advantage of the end of anticlerical despotism to reassert Islamic views and practices and to regain some of their former sociopolitical status."
                            }
                        ]
